  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 01 01 02 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}嗯……咦……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 04 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}我们怎么了……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}诶……\n呀，什么时候牵上手的？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}诶，咦？\n松不开啊！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1B 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}看来，你们已经抵达了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}诶……什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1C 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}这里似乎是一条让邂逅命定伴侣的\n恋人们倾诉爱意的道路。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1D 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}前方究竟有什么在等待呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1E 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}你们可以手牵着手，\n怀着好奇与恐惧迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}那、那是说……\n只有我们两个人……吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1F 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}我说，你们可以迈出脚步，\n也可以不迈出。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}来，迈出脚步吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞机械语音消失了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 46 01 0C 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}诶……说明这就结束了？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:10:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 46 01 0C 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:10:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}啊，那个……\n真伤脑筋啊，{F1 81}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:10:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}我们的手好像松不开了……\n该怎么办才好呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 04 01 02 01 01 01}该道歉的是我{F5 47 02 01 46 01 01 01 05 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}总会有办法吧？{F5 47 02 01 46 01 01 01 05 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:11:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}好像真正的恋人呢{F5 47 02 01 46 01 01 01 05 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}啊，不用道歉。\n又不是你的错。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}那个……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:12:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}糟了……\n我好像特别紧张……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:12:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}和、和男生这样……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:12:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 46 01 0A 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:12:5",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}总、总之，得先习惯才行！\n嗯！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}嗯、嗯……也是。\n慌张也没有用。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}遇到这种事都不动摇，\n果然不愧是队长呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}诶，那个……！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}啊，对、对哦！\n一开始就当成恋人，\n反而就不会那么在意了，对吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:14:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 01}恋、恋人，恋人……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:14:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}……怎么办，更害羞了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 46 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 01}总、总之，先走走看吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e200_313.bf.json:15:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 1A 01}带路就交给你了，那个……\n请多关照。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
